Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(te): apply MC_IB_TIMEOUT to the notification QP as
 well

The notification QP shares the data QPs' NIC, so where the data QPs need a
longer ACK timeout, its fixed 14 (with only 3 retries) is the first to fail.
It now takes the same exponent; its retry count stays 3.

